---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import { media } from '../data/media';
---
<section class="headteacher section"><div class="wrap leader-grid">
  <figure><Image src={media.headteacher.src} widths={[480, 720, 900]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 42vw" alt={media.headteacher.alt} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>Richard Olupot <span>Headteacher</span></figcaption></figure>
  <div><h2>A welcome message from our Headteacher</h2><p>A warm welcome to Amus College School. At Amus, we are committed to nurturing students who are academically strong, morally grounded and prepared to make a meaningful contribution to society. We believe education should develop the whole person through disciplined learning, dedicated teaching and a vibrant school community.</p></div>
</div></section>
